WEBVTT

00:09:56.465 --> 00:10:01.170
Norveška, Švedska, Danska, Nizozemska,

00:10:01.170 --> 00:10:04.100
nudijo univerzalno varstvo otrok,

00:10:04.100 --> 00:10:06.219
pomoč skrbnikom na domu,

00:10:06.219 --> 00:10:09.386
šolanje in predšolsko izobraževanje,

00:10:09.386 --> 00:10:11.596
varstvo nosečnic

00:10:11.596 --> 00:10:15.981
in skrb za starejše in invalide.

00:10:15.981 --> 00:10:19.662
Te vlade investirajo v to infrastrukturo

00:10:19.662 --> 00:10:22.991
na isti način, 
kot investirajo v ceste in mostove

00:10:22.991 --> 00:10:26.126
in tunele in vlake.

00:10:26.126 --> 00:10:28.534
Te družbe nam prav tako kažejo,

00:10:28.534 --> 00:10:30.824
da se hranilstvo in oskrba